{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-letter\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fffaf4; box-sizing: border-box; color: #534236; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 24px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #9a7250; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 0 24px; text-align: left; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #534236; font-size: 18px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; text-align: left\"\u003e见字如面。把这一周来不及当面说的话，慢慢写进这一张带细框的暖色信笺里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 6px 0 12px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #534236; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e给长文一份书信般的温度\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"background-color: #f5ebdc; color: #534236; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 12px 20px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: left\"\u003e克制的信笺边框收住阅读视线，没有大色块轰炸，读起来像拆开朋友从远方寄来的手写信。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 20px auto 20px; padding: 10px 0 10px; width: 84%\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #f5ebdc; color: #534236; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 12px 0; padding: 12px 18px 12px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e慢一点写，慢一点读，有些心事只有在长信里才说得清。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 6px 0 12px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #534236; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e收尾留一缕余温\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"background-color: #f5ebdc; color: #534236; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 12px 20px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: left\"\u003e无论是年终致谢、周更通讯还是生活感悟，这种温润克制的书信体都能拉近和读者的距离。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/rainy-window.jpg\" alt=\"雨天窗边远山与柔和雾气\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: right; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #534236; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e此致，愿你平安顺遂，下封信再叙。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
